{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_catap_set_2_story_1","groupId":"story_catap_set_2","stageId":null,"title":"改變","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_catap_2_1.txt","sourceHash":"901b132ae88a57c9d0cbe015fa0555b3e3d7a18eb4a91fd7c768de0d5d59e1b7","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_county_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米爾偏遠地區\n空爆的家鄉"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"對，就這。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我當初可是在這條街上撒滿了金幣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"別貧了，現在不還是條普通的街道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的可全是實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"實話，你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，別這樣嘛，我可是認真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧好吧，信你一回。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼時候回羅德島？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"就回來看一眼，半天多足夠啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"現在早上七點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就——下午七點左右，在這裡等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"一會給你多帶些特產。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你先確認一下自己會不會被抓再說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"帶好終端，保持通訊暢通，有問題立刻聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"別搞得我和小孩子一樣啊，去吧去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這就嫌我煩了啊，行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不拿特產來我可不載你回去啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，到時候給你弄幾個本地的棗嘗嘗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"好，讓我看看這鬼地方到底有啥變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮子邊還是老樣子嘛，不過鎮中心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，看上去花了不少錢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"要是那死老頭子肯定半枚金幣都不會掏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"小騎士老爺，或許人還不錯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小老爺是真不錯，我們這裡的日子比以前舒坦多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，幾年不見，活得挺滋潤啊菲隆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"收到信還知道回來啊，阿萊塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"看你這身衣服，最近混得不錯嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前可不會直接用名字稱呼我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，把我外號忘了，還是現在看不起我了，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"是是是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"空爆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"您滿意了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"這還差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙和幾年前也沒多大變化嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"出去做啥了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"出去之後找了份賣力氣的活幹，不過報酬還不錯，還能到處旅遊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，在那之後還好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不知道啊，你剛走那會，老頭子把整個鎮子都翻了個遍，結果收回去的財寶連原來的四分之一都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"氣得他啊，直接就把稅翻倍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"啊這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"現在呢，現在還這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒沒有，也就兩三個月吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"後來不知道怎麼了，大城市那裡的調查團來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道老爺們談了點什麼，之後老頭子就再也沒出現過，聽說是去祖宅休養，不管事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小老爺來了之後，先把稅收改了回去，又在鎮裡花了大把的錢，才有了現在這個樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼，小老爺有戲啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣，你難得回來一趟，肯定連路都認不得了，今天我就帶你重新熟悉一下鎮子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"誒誒誒等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我通緝令還在呢，就這麼進去，不合適吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀信上不就和你說過，小老爺上來的時候就把和那件事有關的通緝令全撤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，還信不過你菲隆兄弟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"信，怎麼不信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"你趕緊前頭帶路啊，我看鎮裡面都快變成迷宮了，一個人走準會迷路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你這次回來，準備留多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我們公司的移動艦船正好開過這裡，我就請個小假過來看看，今天就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"出去還變大忙人了？有你的啊空爆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"這不收到你的信特意回來看一眼嗎？真是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊帶路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好走走走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，這裡熟吧，以前我做工的廠房，現在整個重修了一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"裡面還配了空調，比以前舒服得不是一點半點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"菲隆，問你個事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"以前鎮子最外面那塊地，是種吃的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"現在怎麼全是葡萄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"可不單單只是那裡哦，小老爺準備把莊稼地全拿去種葡萄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這地好，種的葡萄品質高，能賣好價錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"那吃的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"不會一日三餐全吃葡萄吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，怎麼會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"種了葡萄，我們有的是錢去其他地方買糧食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"全靠從外頭運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不說城裡的老爺辦法就是多，現在我們這裡的市場能買到好多從沒吃過的玩意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"啊這樣，挺好挺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（小老爺好像是比老頭子可靠些了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（但不種吃的，萬一城裡的老爺抬價，怎麼辦？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"以前啊，城裡的廠子東一個西一個，現在小老爺準備把它們整合到一起，等到時候大廠子建完，我們就能跟著小老爺一起賺大錢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（算啦，這問題太掃興了，沒啥問的必要。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"正好聊到，帶你到大廠子裡看看怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"聽你的，畢竟我在的時候大廠子還一塊磚都沒壘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"還真大啊，老頭子祖宅都沒這規模吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還沒建完呢，一半施工一半運作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"等到時候建完，估計全鎮子的人都能有活幹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"全......都有？不可能吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"“只要想幹活，就有活幹。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小老爺親口和我們說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得小時候餵我們吃蘿蔔的爺爺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"禿頭那個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"以前他家裡人多，用不著他種田，天天閒得慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"現在小老爺給他安排了保安的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"又有事幹又能補貼家用，爺爺可高興了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"是這理沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（但這環境......可不太像個能安心幹活的地方......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"不過小老爺沒想過把廠子旁邊弄乾淨點嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我們過來那一路，滿鼻子都是酸味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小老爺說了，讓我們忍忍，等大廠建好了會一起弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"他可是老頭子的兒子，你還真就每句話都信啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟托小老爺的福，大家這陣子都過得不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我看是你過得不錯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈那是，比以前好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定哪天小老爺把你賣了，你還得陪著笑臉給他數錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不至於不至於。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"那你倒是具體說說，小老爺給了你什麼好處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那可有得好說了，我們找家餐館坐著聊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"餐館？我們這裡都有這麼高檔的東西了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"有啊，便宜管飽味道還不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"有意思，快點帶路，我正好有點餓了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"嗝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，味道不錯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（我還以為是什麼豪華餐廳勒。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（這不是速食店兼酒吧嗎？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（不過我們以前被老頭子收這收那的，吃了上頓沒下頓那都是常有的事。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（速食......好像的確能算是個豪華餐點。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（量大管飽，還不是很貴。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（不過這外頭......變化也太大了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"小老爺不會把以前的鎮中心全拆了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是，基本上全拆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你猜猜，這家速食店以前是什麼地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"噴泉廣場？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在廣場還在吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"拆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"切，連個參照物都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我再想想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"法庭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"近了近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"還不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"總不會是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（模仿爆炸的動作）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"這個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"答對了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"小老爺這是要把老爺子的痕跡全抹乾淨啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"連這地方都給重建了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"那小老爺呢，小老爺住哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"就那兒，頂樓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"一會你出去看看就明白了，那樣的高樓，我們這裡可是獨一棟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮子上有錢和有點名望的人現在都住在那。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"你不也賺了挺多的，怎麼沒搬進去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，和鎮上賺大錢的人比，我還是差了點。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"托你的福，我呢，有了筆積蓄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"老頭子還在橫行霸道的時候，我把它藏得好好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"小老爺上來之後，我就想著把這些錢拿出來，做點小生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"不錯嘛，你從小就運氣好，腦子也好使，一定賺了很多吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"賺？沒有......哪那麼容易......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"本來小老爺要開工廠，劃了一大塊地，我就準備在這地旁邊開小商店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"結果店面租好了，小老爺工廠從另外一頭開始造。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"錢都付了，我只好咬咬牙，把這店開起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"平常會來光顧的也就附近幾戶人家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"每年都小虧，虧到現在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道這工廠啥時候能造過來啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還說小老爺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這你就不懂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"自從那位騎士小姐造訪過老頭子之後，我們這裡也算是有騎士競技比賽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"但真正普及啊，還是全靠小老爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們不僅有比賽看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）還有錢賺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"看比賽......賺錢？有這種好事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（看看手錶）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，下午的比賽快開始了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你票我包了，走，看看去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（聽上去好像挺不錯。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（但我怎麼就覺得，不太對勁呢？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_arena_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"應該就是這排了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（坐下）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"這沙發椅？！嗚啊，好舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"小老爺還真肯花這錢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這室內競技場可是比小老爺住的那棟樓還要大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"在大工廠造完之前，這地方可就是我們鎮上的地標了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"大、氣派、舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能享受這個，不得給小老爺說幾句好話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，那倒是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼椅子上還有終端的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這個啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你說空爆，這個就是我賺錢的秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎各位來到競技場，我是今天這一場比賽的解說員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"首先，有請我們鎮子裡的好小夥，獨立騎士——拉茲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"拉茲？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙不是給老頭子當差的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那天好多人因為你的事被撤職了，拉茲也在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"他本來想回家繼續種田的，但在和那位高貴的騎士小姐偶遇後，他突然就開始說什麼“我想當職業騎士”之類的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始我也以為他在說傻話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"可他是玩真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"在騎士競技被迎到鎮子裡之後，他就跑去做鎮裡第一批職業騎士了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這傢伙本來就長得不錯，手上也有點本事，在鎮裡挺受歡迎的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"當然最主要的還是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"他能贏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不過今天這一場......不太好說啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他的對手，將是前輝煌盾工業裝備測試員，獨立騎士——斯通先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"裝備測試員......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂喂這傢伙一看就不好惹啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂，別急。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位的終端現已開啟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為選手下注？還是購買投放支援物資的籌碼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"騎士們的命運由他們——也由你們決定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"終端亮了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（在終端上一陣點擊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"你在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"別吵，等我一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"斯通贏面大......但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"拉茲的賠率......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"好，這場還是壓拉茲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（在終端上一陣點擊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"你打了......五千？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"這個數字......不是貨幣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。現在只是個數字，但出競技場的時候，終端上打過多少錢，扣完獎金，就得付多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣總有人會付不出來，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"付不出來......就得給小老爺打工還債。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道自己在幹什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我在押拉茲贏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他贏了，我就能再賺一筆，懂嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我研究過了，雖然資料上拉茲不好看，但他會贏的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我賭他會贏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"如果輸了怎麼辦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"是，偶爾我是會失手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"但只要我押拉茲贏，他就一定會贏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你相信他，也相信我，好嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比賽開始！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（不再理睬空爆，雙眼直勾勾看著賽場。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（菲隆......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（你到底知不知道，拉茲和對手在技巧和裝備上根本沒得比？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（一個傭兵熟手，打一個有點天賦的鄉下大頭兵？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（我知道你運氣好，但這樣......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"拉茲，好，打得好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（上來就用死力氣，要是在杜賓教官那裡可是要吃鞭子的。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我告訴你拉茲會贏的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（在終端上輸入了1000）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"好樣的拉茲，狠狠揍他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（他能這樣支撐多久呢？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一刻鐘後"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"拉茲，你怎麼就拼不過那傻大個了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"別，別後退啊，我現在就給你打支援物資！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"（在終端上一陣點擊）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（對方開始反擊了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（等等？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"那個外鄉人怎麼在往死裡打？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這一場本來就是，無、無限制的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我的錢......我，我的錢啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（打開聯絡終端）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）喂聽得到嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要被捕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）差不多吧，你準備一下，把車開到鎮中心那個競技場旁邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）有信心活著開出去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......收到，擔心我還不如擔心你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"保持聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）謝了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（填充彈藥）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（給武器加壓）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"拉茲，拉茲你不可以輸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"你死不要緊我的錢怎麼辦啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"給我讓開！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（這個距離打中還不誤傷......有點懸啊......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（瞄準）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不管了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（拉茲，你這老好人沒必要死在這種地方。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（把欠你的人情還掉，我對這鬼地方也就沒什麼好留念的了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（外地的傻大個，再給我靠過來一點啊！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（扣住扳機）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（屏息凝神）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"精彩的一擊！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"斯通先生在即將獲得勝利的時刻突然回頭望向觀眾席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們好小夥則抓住了這個機會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"舉劍直刺，一招制敵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是教科書般的絕地反擊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解說員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"獨立騎士拉茲——獲得勝利！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"贏，贏了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"贏了！贏了！！我又賺了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟你說什麼來著空爆，嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我買拉茲，他就一定贏。一定贏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"（收回武器）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲隆","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"空爆，空爆？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_g05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到了，看右邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"看來最壞的情況沒發生嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好事好像也沒發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"卡西米爾其他地方都是這樣的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你指的是騎士競技和競技場的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"現在幾點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多下午五六點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我們隨便找個地方吃點東西，買點特產，然後就回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"離這鬼地方越遠越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"*卡西米爾粗口*"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"先上車吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"後面那個捧著一袋子錢想要追上來的，是你朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"只是有點交情，不太熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"開快些吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒覺得沒必要，他裝錢的袋子破了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"回頭撿錢去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"（打方向盤）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是回頭了，怎麼，你還想看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好看的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——好餓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"char_282_catap","isRemote":false,"text":"我們吃飯去吧，兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這不已經上路了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，空爆，我研究過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島外勤幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"餐館馬上就到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_282_catap","aliases":["空爆"]}]}
